<title>POLAND: STOMIL MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 1.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>STOMIL MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 1.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.85 vs   2.11</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.02 vs   2.11</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.89 vs   2.15</p>
<p> Sales		   13.98 vs  12.53</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY	    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     8.65 vs   6.03</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	12.83 vs   6.03</p>
<p> Operating profit    11.64 vs   6.20</p>
<p> Sales		   67.10 vs  57.46</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish tyre maker is Stomil Olsztyn SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
